  "char_latch": "$0704 confirmed to select the two SKATERS in mode 0 (0=A pedestal, 1=B) \u2014 same latch as the surfers.",
  "skater_A_vs_B": "UNLIKE the surfers (which shared 170 tiles and differed only by subpalette), the two SKATERS use DISTINCT tile sets: A=$41-$74, B=$c1-$f4 (both bank 1 PT0). They are different art, not palette-swaps. Confirmed by live capture of both, not assumed.",
